                        <p>> init pyntadev_project --ai-core</p>
                        <p class="text-blue-400"># Setting up dynamic portfolio...</p>
                        <p class="text-yellow-400"># Connecting Payment Gateway (Moota/Xendit)...</p>
                        <p class="text-slate-500">>> Server live at: https://pyntadev.agency</p>
                        <p>> start_business --strategy=dominate</p>
